{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\TimeTracker\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "phpunit/phpunit is in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/AjaxController.php:1309 OCP\\Mail\\IMailer::validateMailAddress(): deprecated since Nextcloud 32; use IEmailValidator::isValid() instead",
        "lib/Service/UserTimeZone.php:35 OCP\\IConfig::getUserValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 33; use IUserConfig directly"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 uses in 2 files of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 31 to 35. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Controller/AjaxController.php:1309 OCP\\Mail\\IMailer::validateMailAddress(): deprecated since Nextcloud 32; use IEmailValidator::isValid() instead",
        "  lib/Service/UserTimeZone.php:35 OCP\\IConfig::getUserValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 33; use IUserConfig directly"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transaction-manual",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/AjaxController.php:1124"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 transaction is opened and closed by hand. The trait TTransactional has atomic() since Nextcloud 24 and atomicRetry() since Nextcloud 27, which repeats a transaction that ran into a deadlock, as the manual recommends.",
        "  lib/Controller/AjaxController.php:1124"
      ]
    },
